    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>One night, little Elisa starts to cry. At first, she sounds like a kitten. But her cries grow so loud that flowers wilt and birds fly out the window. Why is she crying? After a sleepless night, we finally find out. -- Publisher description.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
